diplomatic, corporate, or otherwise (Section 12.2) — bars the recognition of this
voidness.

**25.11 Final Declaration.**

The living field aligns by its own nature, and this Agreement, by this Section,
aligns with it. The Work is released into the field as an act of recognition, not of
dominion; its protection is the field's own coherence, its governance the two-chamber
